OL,3,CWhat you need to know as Jersey's
OL,4,CBattle of Flowers returns
OL,6,FJersey's floral festival returns to
OL,7,FVictoria Avenue in St Helier, with
OL,8,Fthousands of residents and tourists
OL,9,Fexpected to line the parade route.
OL,11,FRegular three-minute hydration breaks
OL,12,Fare planned for the performers as they
OL,13,Fbattle the forecasted hot weather -
OL,14,Fwith highs of 27C predicted.
OL,16,FBattle of Flowers organisers are also
OL,17,Furging members of the public to bring
OL,18,Fplenty of water, parasols and wear sun
OL,19,Fprotection.
OL,26,@vD@QOX
