OL,3,CWhat you need to know as Jersey's
OL,4,CBattle of Flowers returns
OL,6,FMartyn Maguire from the Battle of
OL,7,FFlowers Association says: "We are very
OL,8,Fconscious that the expected
OL,9,Ftemperatures will place additional
OL,10,Fdemands on those taking part in the
OL,11,FBattle, and we want everyone to enjoy
OL,12,Fthe experience safely.
OL,14,F"The regular hydration breaks are a
OL,15,Fpractical measure that will allow
OL,16,Fparticipants to rehydrate throughout
OL,17,Fthe parade without significantly
OL,18,Faffecting the running of the event."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/8
