OL,3,CWhat you need to know as Jersey's
OL,4,CBattle of Flowers returns
OL,6,FThe island's iconic Battle of Flowers
OL,7,Fevent has been running since 1902,
OL,8,Fwhen it was first held to celebrate
OL,9,Fthe Coronation of King Edward VII and
OL,10,FQueen Alexandra.
OL,12,FSince then, it has become a staple in
OL,13,Fthe summer calendar, with parishes and
OL,14,Flocal groups spending months designing
OL,15,Ffloats and choreographing routines to
OL,16,Fshowcase their talents.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/8
