OL,3,CWhat you need to know as Jersey's
OL,4,CBattle of Flowers returns
OL,6,FFrom dancers to drummers, there is
OL,7,Fplenty to keep people entertained and
OL,8,Falongside the main day parade on
OL,9,FFriday 14 August, there is an
OL,10,Filluminated moonlight version the
OL,11,Ffollowing evening - ending with
OL,12,Ffireworks over St Aubin's Bay.
OL,14,FWhen and where can I watch the Battle
OL,15,Fof Flowers?
OL,17,FFriday 14 August
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/8
