OL,3,CWhat you need to know as Jersey's
OL,4,CBattle of Flowers returns
OL,6,FThe area will be open from 1pm with
OL,7,Ffood and drink stalls between the west
OL,8,Fend of Lower Park and the junction of
OL,9,FLa Rue de Galet in St Helier: pre-
OL,10,Fparade entertainment begins at 2pm.
OL,12,FThe Grand Day Parade will start at 3pm
OL,13,Fby the La Motte Ford Garage on La Rue
OL,14,Fde Galet.
OL,16,FFloats will then head east down
OL,17,FVictoria Avenue, ending at Lower Park
OL,18,Fwhere they will be parked up and
OL,19,Fpeople can view them.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
