PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1786645112
OL,3,CWhat you need to know as Jersey's
OL,4,CBattle of Flowers returns
OL,6,FThe parade is expected to finish
OL,7,Faround 5pm and the area will close at
OL,8,F6pm.
OL,10,FSaturday 15 August
OL,12,FThe area will reopen at 6:30pm, with
OL,13,Fpre-parade entertainment from 7:45pm.
OL,15,FThe Moonlight Parade will then begin
OL,16,Fat 8:45pm, westwards from Lower Park
OL,17,Fto La Rue de Galet along Victoria
OL,18,FAvenue.
