OL,3,CWhat you need to know as Jersey's
OL,4,CBattle of Flowers returns
OL,6,FA fireworks display is scheduled for
OL,7,F10:45pm over St Aubin's Bay, with
OL,8,Fpeople encouraged to watch from behind
OL,9,Fthe sea wall.
OL,11,FDo I have to pay?
OL,13,FNo, it is free to watch both parades
OL,14,Fand no tickets are needed.
OL,16,FWhat roads will be closed?
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/8
