OL,3,CWhat you need to know as Jersey's
OL,4,CBattle of Flowers returns
OL,6,FVictoria Avenue and the approach roads
OL,7,Fwill be shut between Bel Royal and
OL,8,FWest Park from 11:30am until 10pm on
OL,9,FFriday 14 August, and from 5pm until
OL,10,F11:59pm on Saturday 15 August.
OL,12,FFollowing that second closure, part of
OL,13,Fthe Avenue from First Tower to West
OL,14,FPark will remain closed until 2am on
OL,15,FSunday 16 August.
